<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 2/3.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 2/3.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>2/3 at 1000GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to</p>
<p>a German mark.</p>
<p>	   April 2/3	April 1/2</p>
<p> CZK	 0.46467	0.46137</p>
<p> DKK	 2.09958	2.10024</p>
<p> FIM	 2.68473	2.6891</p>
<p> HUF	 0.07604	0.07596</p>
<p> JPY	 0.10929	0.10806</p>
<p> LTL	 3.34532	3.3365</p>
<p> LVL	23.1181	23.04412</p>
<p> RUR	 0.00233	0.00233</p>
<p> SEK	 1.76221	1.76517</p>
<p> UAH	 7.16636	7.19946</p>
<p> USD	13.3796	13.346</p>
<p> XEU	15.58121     15.5581</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
